            </span>
            <div>
                <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Kavramlar Sozlugu</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Sistemdeki teknik terimlerin aciklamalari</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-400 transition group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
    </summary>
    <div class="border-t border-gray-100 px-6 pb-6 pt-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Katman</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Her alis islemi bir katman olusturur. Katman turleri: <strong>ALIS</strong> (gercek fatura), <strong>ACILIS</strong> (acilis envanter), <strong>SENTETIK</strong> (fallback fiyatli yapay katman), <strong>DEVIR</strong> (onceki aydan kalan).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">SMM (Satilan Malin Maliyeti)</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">FIFO yontemiyle hesaplanan cikis tutari. Satis gelirinden dusulerek brut kar bulunur.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Sentetik Katman</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Gercek alis faturasi bulunamayan urunler icin fallback fiyattan olusturulan yapay katman. Bu urunler "Sorunlu Stoklar" raporunda listelenir.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Fallback Fiyat</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Gercek fatura yoksa kullanilan varsayilan birim fiyat. "Ayarlar &gt; Fallback Fiyat" sayfasindan urun bazinda tanimlanir.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Batch</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">500 urunluk gruplar halinde toplu hesaplama. Sistemi kilitlememek ve ilerleme takibi icin kullanilir. Her batch bagimsiz olarak calisir.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">TVP (Table-Valued Parameter)</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">SQL Server'a toplu veri gondermek icin kullanilan yontem. Batch'teki 500 StkId tek seferde SP'ye gonderilir.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Mekan</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Sube anlaminda kullanilir. Degerler: <strong>1</strong>=Merkez, <strong>12</strong>=Sube-12, <strong>4477</strong>=Sube-4477, <strong>4478</strong>=Sube-4478.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Envanter Tarihi</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Stok sayim tarihi. Genellikle 31 Aralik secilir. Sistemin baslangic noktasidir &mdash; bu tarihten itibaren FIFO hesaplama baslar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Donem (YilAy)</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Yil-Ay bazinda hesaplama periyodu. Ornegin <strong>202601</strong> = Ocak 2026. Her donem icin ayri FIFO ve ortalama maliyet hesaplanir.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-100 p-3">
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">StkId</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">DerinSIS ERP'deki urun kimlik numarasi. Tum tablolarda ortak anahtar olarak kullanilir.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</details>

